ExactRange.rand32_contract → oorandom::Rand32::rand_range
  precondition: Every represented state/range, typed width equals end.val-start.val. Invalid range asserts in debug extraction. For valid ranges, least accepted candidate n implies normal return with exact high-product-plus-start sample and candidate_n generator state; all rejected implies divergence. Canonical threshold is proved. Existence of an accepted index is conditional, not guaranteed; uniformity/period/runtime are unproved. Original crate and original std wrapping_neg bodies; official pinned nonmonomorphic extraction; no new provider/model.
