es plus four finite-export Into/TryInto owner specializations,28 named theorems/helpers coimported with standard axioms; patch963996393e9f9c67106e2dd64a9cc2a4fb48f9ec06f5aeb127c568f6a79defd1/rawbinary96e2e328ec0b5a2e53599474ded998b450311f5d4fdf828b39b422885b03bb9b, reproducible snapshot in evidence/conditional-generic6. The six generic external families use finite compiler-owned source/body observations, giving twenty machine contracts under the stated bounds and trust conditions. Exact-range trace final116-file freeze2421cdf9e13e06519d1d45995d3bff786b96ecbd298b12e1dac9747f58c789f7 independently reviewed;22 bounded module jobs/rawlogs have63 unique audited declarations in aggregate, not63 from one finalcoimport. ExactRange2 map to original public bodies through the ordinary source scanner; sourcevalidation and old12 retention are separately recorded."
